  "question": {
    "text": "As shown in figure, the tension in the horizontal cord is <math><mn>30</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>N</mn><mo>.</mo></math> The weight <math><mi>w</mi></math> and tension in the string <math><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></math> in newton are<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/hgjwghrpvdqcipqrlreosgakyazirbtqpaktztdqodzezvjflp.png\" />",
    "image": null
