  "solution": {
    "text": "Horizontal and vertical components of tension are shown in the figure.<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/jjvllyanlrsgplfbvrjtuopfjfqrqnipaprokyntkxbibzfqda.png\" /><br /><br />From the figure, <math><mi>T</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mrow></math> .....(i)<br /><br /><math><mi>T</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow></mrow></math> .....(ii)<br /><br />By solving Equations (i) and (ii), we get<br /><br /><math><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>&nbsp;N</mi></math><br /><br />and <math><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mn>N</mn></math>",
    "image": null
  },
